          "f": 1500,
          "gain_db": -3.0,
          "q": 0.7
        },
        {
          "type": "lowpass",
          "f": 8000,
          "q": 0.707
        }
      ],
      "why": "Baritone from tenor trombone: same register and bore size class, but conical valved tone with less edge."
